; ted-detok-no-length-check (#355): detoka5 expands a tokenised line into
; charbuff3 (the last 130 bytes of TED's buffer block of 2438 bytes)
; without a length check.  blitz2 under inject pad (64 zeroed bytes behind
; every allocation, checked when it is freed), a tokenised file: "x",
; 23 x "NPrint:" (69 bytes, 161 characters detokenised), "y".  Block from
; the start of line 1 to the end of line 2 (BOTTOM, F2 at the start of
; line 3), Block Kill: detoka5 for the last block line.  SAVE, QUIT (TED
; frees its buffer block).  Correct: nothing is written behind the block;
; the original writes the text behind it (inject: "written behind").
; Fixed in TED-C: detoka5 stops silently at the end of the buffer.
; @fixed #355
; @file bo.bb2 "x\x00\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:"
; @file bo.bb2 "\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:"
; @file bo.bb2 "\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\xdd\x82:\x00y\x00"
; @source F bo.bb2
; @command TEDAB:tools/inject pad blitz2:blitz2 @FILE@
; @expect nostdout "inject: pad: written behind an allocation of 2438 bytes"
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
key 50
menu 2 1
key 51
menu 1 1
menu 0 2
wait freq "Name to save file as"
freq ok
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
